    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/117e29c73d48aecb8271a5dd563eae57.poster.avif?t=1755435575\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/117e29c73d48aecb8271a5dd563eae57.webm?t=1755435575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/117e29c73d48aecb8271a5dd563eae57.mp4?t=1755435575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/16d258c8b914c18a69ee7c8d6b79fdba.avif?t=1755435575\" width=286 height=23 /></span>\u00a0you've returned from the<strong> horrors of war</strong> to find your wife and daughter  missing. Years later, you're still searching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/e4c24ad16ee76b3a190be0ac8b25998e.avif?t=1755435575\" width=328 height=23 /></span>\u00a0c<strong>hasing the unexplained</strong>. With every story, you hold on to the hope that one day, something will lead you back to them.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/68155410c964bbfd56305f82789bd240.poster.avif?t=1755435575\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/68155410c964bbfd56305f82789bd240.webm?t=1755435575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/68155410c964bbfd56305f82789bd240.mp4?t=1755435575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/13d44802849336b358d0db45be1c2c07.avif?t=1755435575\" width=240 height=18 /></span>\u00a0takes you to '<strong>Breken House</strong>' in  England's snowy West Country. It feels familiar in a way that unsettles you, like you\u2019re finally close\u2026 or about to lose them all over again.     <br>      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/fcd3a3d853d98199150e4fe27c509cb0.poster.avif?t=1755435575\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/fcd3a3d853d98199150e4fe27c509cb0.webm?t=1755435575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/fcd3a3d853d98199150e4fe27c509cb0.mp4?t=1755435575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/3f058b2c1394d097557d0027b72a8886.avif?t=1755435575\" width=150 height=18 /></span>\u00a0detective Gwen Porter\u2019s case begins with a missing patient and a dead orderly, leading her into a <strong>tangled mystery that connects lives, past and present.</strong>    <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/fd0bf0ef7ba739608fc97e2f831083e1.poster.avif?t=1755435575\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/fd0bf0ef7ba739608fc97e2f831083e1.webm?t=1755435575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/fd0bf0ef7ba739608fc97e2f831083e1.mp4?t=1755435575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/8533e2a5f6ca463a531c8e295fe5456b.avif?t=1755435575\" width=303 height=18 /></span>as you sort through <strong>shards of memory's</strong> and scraps of <strong>evidence</strong>. What John forgot may be the key to solving Gwen\u2019s case.      <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/141aac46eb38996fe4bb73da44bc60c6.poster.avif?t=1755435575\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/141aac46eb38996fe4bb73da44bc60c6.webm?t=1755435575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/141aac46eb38996fe4bb73da44bc60c6.mp4?t=1755435575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/c098001b8920728465a3725ff8a7ae79.avif?t=1755435575\" width=198 height=18 /></span>you're haunted by\u00a0memories of<strong> D-Day, 1944,\u00a0</strong>orders lost in smoke, and the friends who didn\u2019t make it home. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/7abb3cf31fee7097d17106eb499fa1cf.poster.avif?t=1755435575\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/7abb3cf31fee7097d17106eb499fa1cf.webm?t=1755435575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/7abb3cf31fee7097d17106eb499fa1cf.mp4?t=1755435575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/4bb3fbfa7270579b002bd470eb4722d3.avif?t=1755435575\" width=500 height=25 /></span>With <u><strong>8 unique endings</strong></u><strong>\u00a0-</strong>\u00a0Choose your words carefully  some decisions cannot be undone. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/cd4cff7f116e6303316efe1246172639.avif?t=1755435575\" width=500 height=25 /></span>A fully voiced narrative experience, delivered by a professional cast.  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/45335f87295315f1c8337741119f5832.avif?t=1755435575\" width=540 height=25 /></span>John &amp; Gwen's stories weave together in the past and present  as does the <strong>consequences</strong> of <span class=\"bb_strike\">their</span>\u00a0your decisions.  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/0c97f4e3235c75d9aa84ba83a40ae4ce.avif?t=1755435575\" width=540 height=25 /></span>Beautifully produced dark cello soundtrack supporting the game\u2019s themes of loss and memory, shifting between tension and sorrow, and rising to fear and action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/560ff3729582378969260b0de39e6333.avif?t=1755435575\" width=540 height=25 /></span>Hollow Mire is inspired by <strong>themes of mid-20th century, England,</strong>\u00a0at a time when the country was recovering from war. A time before computers, before cell phones. Food rationing was still in effect and many families were coming to terms with the idea that many of the soldiers who went to Europe were never coming home.\u00a0 \u00a0<strong> </strong>  <br>  <br><strong>In 1952 a large blizzard swept across England</strong>, particularly impacting the West Country where Hollow Mire is set. The dark, snowy Devonshire Countryside is a truly beautiful and equally atmospheric place. It's quiet, lonely, dark and remote.     <br>  <br> You'll return to Normandy on <strong>June 6th 1944 (D-Day),</strong> seen as the turning point of the second World War. Part of the 9th Parachute Battalion, dropping behind enemy lines ahead of the main landings, and later visiting the camps.\u00a0     <br>  <br>Players should expect Hollow Mire to visit <strong>mature themes</strong> in some of the <strong>most difficult times in human history</strong>.\u00a0  <br>  <br>All environments are hand-painted with a focus on realism, a blend of Victorian and Edwardian architecture.   <br>  <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/117e29c73d48aecb8271a5dd563eae57.poster.avif?t=1755435575\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/117e29c73d48aecb8271a5dd563eae57.webm?t=1755435575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/117e29c73d48aecb8271a5dd563eae57.mp4?t=1755435575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/16d258c8b914c18a69ee7c8d6b79fdba.avif?t=1755435575\" width=286 height=23 /></span>\u00a0you've returned from the<strong> horrors of war</strong> to find your wife and daughter  missing. Years later, you're still searching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/e4c24ad16ee76b3a190be0ac8b25998e.avif?t=1755435575\" width=328 height=23 /></span>\u00a0c<strong>hasing the unexplained</strong>. With every story, you hold on to the hope that one day, something will lead you back to them.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/68155410c964bbfd56305f82789bd240.poster.avif?t=1755435575\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/68155410c964bbfd56305f82789bd240.webm?t=1755435575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/6815