        "notes": "Disclaimer\r\n\r\nThis game contains content that may be disturbing, unsettling, or triggering to some individuals. It explores sensitive themes, including but not limited to:\r\n\r\nConcentration Camps: The game presents a depiction of a concentration camp and related historical events. These are portrayed in a respectful and sensitive manner to foster understanding of their historical impact.\r\n\r\nHorror Elements: The game features horror themes that may cause discomfort or fear. Player discretion is advised.\r\n\r\nPsychosis, PTSD, and Mental Health Conditions: The narrative includes themes of psychosis, PTSD, and other mental health struggles. These elements are handled with care, but may be distressing for those who have personal experience with these conditions.\r\n\r\nMedical Treatments: The game involves depictions of medical treatments, including electroshock therapy, in a historical context. These depictions are intended for storytelling purposes and may be unsettling.\r\n\r\nViolence and Death: The game includes graphic violence and depictions of death, which may be upsetting to some players.\r\n\r\nOther Mature Themes: The game features other mature and potentially disturbing themes. Player discretion is strongly advised before proceeding.\r\n\r\nBy continuing to play, you acknowledge that you are aware of these themes and consent to engaging with this content. If you are sensitive to any of the aforementioned topics, or if you are under the age of 18, we recommend exercising caution or seeking alternative content."
